  "questionLabels": [],
  "question": {
    "text": "The current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> flows in a square loop of sides <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is placed in air. The magnetic field at the centre of the loop is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> is _________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "40",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Magnetic field at the centre of the square loop is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math> is perpendicular distance of the centre to one of its sides.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>×</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
